          "widget": {
            "name": "w1",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "# Brightwater - Warranty Cost & Supplier Quality\n",
                "\n",
                "**The event** — claims per 1,000 bikes climbed from ~7.5 to ~10/month this summer (+34%). The driver is hidden in generic dealer labor codes: AI-classified technician notes reveal a **Hanlin MC-48 controller water-ingress** failure on lots HX-2605+ (PCN-0419 coating change, never approved). Remaining warranty exposure **~$977K**.\n",
                "\n",
                "**What to see** — the failure-mode bar puts **motor-controller water ingress** (orange) on top, far above every everyday mode · the Hanlin-lot bars light up the PCN-0419 lots in orange · wet regions dominate the claims."
              ]
            }
          },
